<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Industrial shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Industrial shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian property developer Berjaya Industrial Bhd said on Friday that it was requesting that its shares be suspended from trading on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it would be informing the stock exchange of its reasons for seeking the suspension &quot;shortly&quot;.</p>
<p>Berjaya Industrial shares closed up one cent to 1.98 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
